<p>President Donald Trump said on Saturday that he is sending a hospital ship to Greenland, calling it a “great hospital boat” that is “on the way” to care for “many people who are sick” on the Arctic island, an autonomous Danish territory. He did not say which vessel would deploy, how many patients it would treat, or whether Greenlandic or Danish authorities asked for help. The announcement comes as US-Denmark tensions have risen alongside Trump’s interest in Greenland. Trump tied the planned deployment to Louisiana Governor Jeff Landry, but reports said key details were still unclear.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/7UvPAWgVbAnNcFYMQdneQVlhBKbsirrh2LUWrakrWxAZDlPVskHguUhGwdOxKc9gaFOYsn_x62WlONXVUcmsZN-d17h3pjdiUZ0awozj4sZk' alt='An AI-generated image shared by President Donald Trump on Truth Social showing a hospital ship headed toward Greenland.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>AI image detail: Trump’s Truth Social post included what appeared to be an AI-generated image showing the USNS Mercy sailing toward snowcapped mountains; reports noted the Mercy is a 272-meter ship typically stationed in southern California and said it was unclear whether it is the vessel actually being sent.</li><li>Trump’s framing: Trump said the sick people he referenced were “not being taken care of there,” but he did not identify who needed treatment or how many people the ship would help.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>President Donald Trump: Trump framed the deployment as humanitarian help, saying people in Greenland were “not being taken care of there”. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1974985/trump-says-great-hospital-boat-on-the-way-to-greenland'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>Danish monarchy: Denmark’s King Frederik X traveled to Greenland this week, which was reported as a show of presence as attention and anxiety grow around US interest in the island. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1974985/trump-says-great-hospital-boat-on-the-way-to-greenland'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>Deutsche Welle: DW said Trump’s claim comes amid a broader rift between the United States and Europe over the strategically important island. (<a href='https://www.dw.com/en/trump-says-sending-great-hospital-boat-to-greenland/a-76076414'>Deutsche Welle</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1974985/trump-says-great-hospital-boat-on-the-way-to-greenland'>Trump says ‘great’ hospital boat on the way to Greenland</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://www.firstpost.com/world/trump-announces-hospital-ship-deployment-to-greenland-to-aid-many-people-who-are-sick-13982400.html'>Trump announces hospital ship deployment to Greenland to aid &#x27;many people who are sick&#x27;</a> - firstpost.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3344236/trump-sends-great-hospital-boat-treat-sick-people-greenland'>Trump sends ‘great’ hospital boat to treat ‘sick’ people in Greenland</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/trump-says-sending-great-hospital-boat-to-greenland/a-76076414'>Trump says sending &#x27;great hospital boat&#x27; to Greenland</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/united-states/trump-says-he-is-sending-a-hospital-ship-to-greenland'>Trump says he is sending a hospital ship to Greenland</a> - straitstimes.com</li></ul>